              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA obu yaboine Leeya nkooku anoberwe, yamuha oruzaaro, baitu Rakeeri, yaba ngumba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leeya yatwara enda, yazaara omwana omwojo, yamuruka ibara Rubbeni, yagamba ati: “MUKAMA arozire okubonabona kwange, mazimakwo, iba nyowe hati naija kungonza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagaruka yatwara enda, yazaara omwana ondi omwojo, yagamba ati: “MUKAMA amanyire nkooku nnoberwe, nukwo kunyongera omwana ondi.” Yamuruka ibara Simyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatwara enda, yazaara omwana omwojo, yagamba ati: “Hati, nyowe na iba nyowe, nitwija kwikirraniza, habwokuba nakamuzarra abaana aboojo basatu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
